      <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12s4.5 10 10 10 10-4.5 10-10S17.5 2 12 2zm-2 15l-5-5 1.4-1.4L10 14.2l7.6-7.6L19 8l-9 9z"/></svg>Delivered by email</span>
